  The caption's '📝 விண்ணப்பிக்கும் முறை' line says applicants can upload documents and pick a bank, but the article only says students can apply by registering on the portal and uploading documents, with the bank-branch choice listed as an option; this is roughly fine. However, the 'நாள்' line gives the date 'நவம்பர் 17, 2026' as today's date, which is the posting date and is exempt, so no problem there.
